y Components:**\n\n1. **IPv4 Lookahead** - `(?=(?:[^\\n])*IPv4_PATTERN)`:\n   - Ensures the line contains a valid IPv4 address\n   - `[1-9]?[0-9]|1[0-9]{2}|2[0-4][0-9]|25[0-5]` matches octets 0-255 without leading zeros\n\n2. **Date Pattern** with month/day validation:\n   - `(01|03|05|07|08|10|12)-(0[1-9]|[12][0-9]|3[01])` for 31-day months\n   - `(04|06|09|11)-(0[1-9]|[12][0-9]|30)` for 30-day months\n   - `02-(0[1-9]|[12][0-9])` for February (up to day 29)\n\n3. **Last Date Only** - `(?!(?:[^\\n])*DATE_PATTERN)`:\n   - Negative lookahead that rejects the match if another date appears later on the same line\n   - Ensures only the last date in a line is matched\n\n4. **Boundary Protection** - `(?<![a-zA-Z0-9])` and `(?![a-zA-Z0-9])`:\n   - Prevents false matches like \"user1134-12-25\" or \"192.168.1.1abc\"\n   - Ensures dates/IPs aren't immediately preceded or followed by alphanumeric characters","ttft_ms":85374,"type":"result","duration_ms":89291,"uuid":"62b8655a-be60-49c9-8856-790eb29385e4","ttft_stream_ms":732,"time_to_request_ms":44,"queued_turn_count":0}
